quency and line voltages","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3131-3","via":"3131","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1},{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":2,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.401,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.24,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#52","text":"Taking readings from charts, meters and gauges at established intervals, troubleshooting and performing corrective action as necessary","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3131-4","via":"3131","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.603,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.3325,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#53","text":"Completing and maintaining station records, logs and reports, and communicating with other plant personnel to assess equipment operating status","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3131-5","via":"3131","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.819,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.4575,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#54","text":"Cleaning and maintaining equipment such as generators, boilers, turbines, pumps, and compressors in order to prevent equipment failure or deterioration.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3131-6","via":"3131","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.134,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.135,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#55","text":"Power engineers","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#56","text":"Operate automated or computerized control systems, stationary engines and auxiliary equipment such as reactors, boilers, turbines, generators, pumps, compressors, pollution control devices and other equipment to generate electrical power and to provide light, heat, ventilation and refrigeration for buildings, industrial plants and other work sites","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#57","text":"Monitor and inspect plant equipment, computer terminals, switches, valves, gauges, alarms, meters and other instruments to measure temperature, pressure and fuel flow to detect leaks or other equipment malfunctions and to ensure plant equipment is operating at maximum efficiency","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#58","text":"Analyze and record instrument readings and equipment malfunctions","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#59","text":"Troubleshoot and perform corrective action and minor repairs to prevent equipment or system failure","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#60","text":"Respond to emergency situations if required","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","ref":"92100.01","via":"92100","match":"statcan_concordance","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"51-8013.03#61","text":"Clean and lubricate generators, turbines, pumps and compressors and perform other routine equipment maintenance duties using appropriate lubricants and hand, power and precision tools","kind":"duty","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"oasis","r